@Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5582

### List products
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/products/
Accept: application/json

### Get product
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/products/aurora-headphones/
Accept: application/json

### Login as demo seller
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seller@lumiere.app",
  "password": "Seller123!"
}

### Create product (Sellers only) — set token from login response
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My First Product",
  "tagline": "A test product",
  "description": "Created via the API.",
  "price": 99,
  "category": "Audio",
  "colors": ["#1a1a1a"],
  "imageUrls": ["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505740420928-5e560c06d30e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"]
}